1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,740
O eremita cresceu.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,510
E a concha apertou.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,030
Ele encontra outra

4
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:06,810
e testa a abertura.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,940
Se couber,

6
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,750
ele troca de concha.

7
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,990
A antiga fica na areia.

8
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:15,840
E ele segue viagem.

